{
  "name": "infra",
  "description": "A NixOS-based infrastructure repository for Hellas AI's EZGen platform, leveraging Colmena for multi-host deployment and Disko for declarative ZFS storage orchestration. It implements a custom secret management layer using GPG-encrypted pass stores and Nix library helpers to securely inject environment variables into distributed Rust services. The system integrates a comprehensive observability stack including Prometheus, Grafana, Loki, and Jaeger across Hetzner-based compute nodes.",
